    "Replace existing delivery drone visual asset only unless gameplay changes are separately requested.",
    "Use mesh-capable renderer/export. Generic BBMODEL uses native units; static OBJ uses blocks.",
    "Each rotor rotates around its own native Y pivot, alternating directions. Do not rotate motors or arms.",
    "Runtime cargo must be separately rendered using the same interpolated drone transform and cargo_center_anchor. The chest reference is not a real inventory implementation.",
