    "The reserved empty bay is 1.25 blocks in width/depth/height. A double chest (2 blocks wide) does not fit at 1:1 scale.",
    "Maintain current drone controls, camera, physics, inventory and saved IDs. Anchors and preview clips implement none of these systems.",
    "Separate render/culling bounds (including rotor swept discs) from collision/damage.",
    "Preserve grounded foot datum Y=0 and allow enough clearance for the tall frame.",
    "No bag or chest is baked into the production model. Fitting reference belongs only to the separate fit scene."
